<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Boeing, Raytheon cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Boeing, Raytheon cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said analyst Jack Modzelewski downgraded Boeing Co to attractive from buy and cut Raytheon Co to neutral from attractive.</p>
<p>-- the analyst was not immediately available for details.</p>
<p>-- Boeing was off 1-1/8 to 55-3/4 and Raytheon slipped 3/8 to 53-3/8.</p>
</text>
